# =====================================================================
# Sistem environment mobile (Expo env — variabel EXPO_PUBLIC_* ter-inline
# saat build, jadi ganti nilai = harus build ulang):
#   - .env.development → `expo start` / build debug (NODE_ENV=development)
#   - .env.production  → gradle assembleRelease / eas build (NODE_ENV=production)
#   - .env             → override personal, gitignored
#   - .env.local       → override personal per-NODE_ENV, gitignored
# Urutan prioritas (tertinggi dulu): .env.{mode}.local > .env.{mode} > .env.local > .env
# =====================================================================

